Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Ansys MCP and Maxwell workflow", "Title",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"b44fdacd-5d6f-dd48-9c34-c9ba3d07efa5"],

Cell["\:7f2a\:96e8\:8f69 / Miao Yuxuan \[CenterDot] \:6dee\:5357\:5e08\:8303\
\:5b66\:9662 / Huainan Normal University", "Subtitle",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"4564edea-f77a-5649-bad1-0a5af7418602"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model, inputs and scope", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"aa76f23c-39ad-ea47-a1fa-33aba64d4315"],

Cell["Common terminal voltage and total RMS current", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"a517ef8b-4d51-8843-9bf6-24f557cab317"],

Cell["SI; exp(+j omega t); RMS; sigma=58 MS/m; mu_r=1; 20 C", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"d899ceed-b9ca-f04d-acb9-2df0535670c2"],

Cell["\<\
Run resource preflight; execute the native seven-strand MCP example when \
Maxwell is available.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"ab7db15d-9508-af46-93ee-a0508ab71df9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Derivation and interpretation", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"e36e9f1b-83ee-394a-b51d-b5a66fb4491e"],

Cell["\<\
This Notebook performs the resource preflight. The complete MCP case starts \
an owned Student gRPC Desktop, connects the upstream server, constructs seven \
voltage windings and a controlled return, and solves two linear bases plus a \
constrained final case.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"c6b8e00e-ffc4-f049-94da-597948fb46ce"],

Cell["\<\
AEDT voltage inputs are peak values; the adapter converts RMS inputs by \
\[Sqrt]2 and reconstructs RMS complex currents and power. Maxwell \
CPython/PyAEDT execution differs from the embedded AEDT RunScript environment.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"6e1834d1-7a4a-e848-bdf1-41486213a72d"],

Cell["\<\
Inspect actual units, axial model depth, frequency, project contents, mesh \
statistics, complex strand currents and input/loss balance. A one-pass \
Student mesh supports only the explicitly reported comparison scope.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"e50ed43c-a448-2c4f-903f-420cf0ecceff"],

